sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client agent
    participant D as Agent Card<br/>/.well-known/agent-card.json
    participant S as TYPO3 A2A server<br/>/api/agent-nexus/a2a/jsonrpc
    participant T as Task store
    C->>D: GET the Agent Card
    D-->>C: supportedInterfaces, skills (A2A 1.0)
    C->>S: SendStreamingMessage (A2A-Version: 1.0)
    S->>T: save task: SUBMITTED
    S-->>C: task
    S->>T: save: WORKING
    S-->>C: statusUpdate: WORKING
    S->>T: save: INPUT_REQUIRED
    S-->>C: statusUpdate: INPUT_REQUIRED (stream closes)
    C->>S: SendStreamingMessage with taskId (the answer)
    S-->>C: task, statusUpdate: WORKING
    S-->>C: artifactUpdate chunks (append, lastChunk)
    S->>T: save: artifact, COMPLETED
    S-->>C: statusUpdate: COMPLETED (stream closes)
    C->>S: GetTask / ListTasks
    S->>T: read
    S-->>C: the stored Task
